commit 74c5a43b
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-24 03:28:37 -0600
subject: fix(db): flushRequestDetails export + backupDbLite FK stripping

- src/lib/db/repos/requestDetailsRepo.js: export flushRequestDetails()
  as public wrapper around internal flushToDatabase() (barrel already
  re-exports it but the function was missing)
- src/lib/db/backup.js: strip FOREIGN KEY/REFERENCES clauses pointing
  at excluded tables (requestDetails) from CREATE TABLE SQL before
  executing in bak schema. Migrations 003+004 create message_facets and
  message_annotations with REFERENCES requestDetails(id) ON DELETE
  CASCADE — these failed CREATE TABLE in bak because requestDetails
  doesn't exist there. Also: drop adapter.transaction() wrapper
  (SAVEPOINT + ATTACH DDL fragile on node:sqlite), add index copy,
  clean up partial backup on failure.

MiMo #4 APPROVE (codex mock), MiMo #5 APPROVE (backup FK strip).
request-details-tab: 22/22 pass, codex-image-fetch: 4/4 pass.


